      "title": "USER MANUAL",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "This workflow will lip-sync the input image with the input audio file.\n\nUsing more than 125 frames (5 seconds) may exceed VRAM capacity.\n\nYou can set the image size to 720x720 pixels.\n\nMODELS\n\n[fantasytalking_fp16.safetensors 1600MB](https://huggingface.co/Kijai/WanVideo_comfy/resolve/main/fantasytalking_fp16.safetensors)\n\nfolder> models/diffusion_models\n\n---\n\n[img2vid 480 wan](https://huggingface.co/Kijai/WanVideo_comfy/resolve/main/Wan2_1-I2V-14B-480P_fp8_e4m3fn.safetensors)\n\nfolder> models/diffusion_models\n\n---\n\n[umt5xxl text encoder](https://huggingface.co/Kijai/WanVideo_comfy/resolve/main/umt5-xxl-enc-bf16.safetensors)\n\nfolder> models/clip\n\n---\n\n[clipvision h](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.1_ComfyUI_repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/clip_vision/clip_vision_h.safetensors)\n\nfolder> models/clip_vision\n\n---\n\n[wan vae](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.1_ComfyUI_repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/vae/wan_2.1_vae.safetensors)\n\nfolder> models/vae\n\n---\n\n\n\n[GITHUB PAGE](https://github.com/Fantasy-AMAP/fantasy-talking)\n\n[KIJAI](https://huggingface.co/Kijai/WanVideo_comfy/tree/main)"
